{
 "source": "geneva",
 "book": "2SA",
 "chapter": 23,
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.23.1",
   "range": "2SA.23.1",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "51ecb607",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.23.1#p1-51ecb607",
     "text": "Which he spoke after he had written the psalms.",
     "label": "a",
     "anchor": "last words of David"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.23.2",
   "range": "2SA.23.2",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "4754b50f",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.23.2#p1-4754b50f",
     "text": "Meaning, he spoke nothing but by the motion of God's Spirit.",
     "label": "b",
     "anchor": "tongue"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.23.4",
   "range": "2SA.23.4",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "c64948b0",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.23.4#p1-c64948b0",
     "text": "Which grows quickly, and fades soon.",
     "label": "c",
     "anchor": "grass springing out of the earth"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.23.5",
   "range": "2SA.23.5",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "0e052041",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.23.5#p1-0e052041",
     "text": "But that my kingdom may continue for ever according to his promise.",
     "label": "d",
     "anchor": "grow"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.23.8",
   "range": "2SA.23.8",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "0a3f2f4f",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.23.8#p1-0a3f2f4f",
     "text": "As one of the king's counsel.",
     "label": "e",
     "anchor": "seat"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.23.9",
   "range": "2SA.23.9",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "353adba4",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.23.9#p1-353adba4",
     "text": "Meaning, fled from the battle.",
     "label": "f",
     "anchor": "gone away"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.23.10",
   "range": "2SA.23.10",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "8450676c",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.23.10#p1-8450676c",
     "text": "By a cramp which came from weariness and fighting.",
     "label": "g",
     "anchor": "hand clave unto the sword"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.23.12",
   "range": "2SA.23.12",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "5690987a",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.23.12#p1-5690987a",
     "text": "Which has no respect for many or few, when he will show his power.",
     "label": "h",
     "anchor": "great victory"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.23.15",
   "range": "2SA.23.15",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "4cc98d72",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.23.15#p1-4cc98d72",
     "text": "Being overcome with weariness and thirst.",
     "label": "i",
     "anchor": "longed"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.23.16",
   "range": "2SA.23.16",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "6bc69f88",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.23.16#p1-6bc69f88",
     "text": "Bridling his affection, and also desiring God not to be offended for that rash enterprise.",
     "label": "k",
     "anchor": "poured it out unto the LORD"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.23.21",
   "range": "2SA.23.21",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "37f3c1e9",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.23.21#p1-37f3c1e9",
     "text": "Which was as big as a weavers beam, 1Ch 11:23.",
     "label": "l",
     "anchor": "spear in his hand",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ch 11:23",
       "ref": "1CH.11.23"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.23.23",
   "range": "2SA.23.23",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "5407bb80",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.23.23#p1-5407bb80",
     "text": "He was more valiant than the thirty that follow and not so valiant as the six before.",
     "label": "m",
     "anchor": "thirty"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.23.27",
   "range": "2SA.23.27",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "7cc6cacb",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.23.27#p1-7cc6cacb",
     "text": "Some of these had two names, 1Ch 11:29 and also many more are mentioned there.",
     "label": "n",
     "anchor": "Mebunnai the Hushathite",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ch 11:29",
       "ref": "1CH.11.29"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.23.39",
   "range": "2SA.23.39",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "ea6f1b91",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.23.39#p1-ea6f1b91",
     "text": "These came to David, and helped restore him to his kingdom.",
     "label": "o",
     "anchor": "thirty and seven in all"
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}
